        <description>&lt;img src="https://pho3nix-jacki3.github.io/categories/portswigger/portswigger-edit.png" alt="Featured image of post Exploiting Java Deserialization with Apache Commons" /&gt;&lt;/br&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://pho3nix-jacki3.github.io/p/exploiting-java-deserialization-with-apache-commons/img/8ddf90f36a578c3e.jpg&#34;
